        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cogen unit 200kWe diesel SCR, components for electricity only</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cogen unit 200kWe diesel SCR, components for electricity only
The module summarises infrastructure components of a cogeneration unit. ;
Synonyms: Selective Catalytic Reduction, SCR; 
UUID: f83267b1-e90a-3ed6-9c67-23024d78ffd5
The module includes all components related exclusively to electricity production.
Location: Extrapolated from data of a plant in Switzerland, assumed valid for Europe (RER).
Technology: Partly extrapolated from data of a 160kWe lambda=1 natural gas plant, adjusted to diesel cogen with SCR and oxidation catalytic converters.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Operator and manufacturer information 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text, see Technolgy Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f83267b1-e90a-3ed6-9c67-23024d78ffd5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
